<title>INDONESIA: Bank Niaga 1996 net up to 97.98 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Bank Niaga 1996 net up to 97.98 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>				(in billions of rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    97.98    vs  63.96</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rupiah)     613	vs  553</p>
<p>    Net interest income		  321.35  vs  238.03</p>
<p>    Other operating income		97.39  vs   88.49</p>
<p>    Other operating expense	    285.81  vs  238.52</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 140.27  vs   92.81</p>
<p>    Retained earnings		    234.82  vs  160.53</p>
<p>NOTE: The consolidated results were audited. PT Bank Niaga is among Indonesia's largest privately-owned banks.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
